    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u5ba2\u670dQ\u7fa4\uff1a156688756</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752716648\" /></span>To aid the King, Priestess Konoha plunges into &quot;Grimoire&quot;! The world inside &quot;Grimoire&quot; is formed by another world called Grimoire Land in which Konoha becomes a magical girl, and has come to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752716648\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/e2ab7bc3ad4587fe7b1ffafa3719988b.poster.avif?t=1752716648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/e2ab7bc3ad4587fe7b1ffafa3719988b.webm?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/e2ab7bc3ad4587fe7b1ffafa3719988b.mp4?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with total freedom, unrestricted by scenario progression. Numerous dungeons and towns are scattered across the vast field, appealing to your sense of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party-based RPG</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just the protagonist, but you can also adventure with companions. Along with your companions found around the world, you can strengthen the party, learn unique field skills that bring various benefits wherever you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/3294ed33cb9ab4ea1b159f98ddb243b2.poster.avif?t=1752716648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/3294ed33cb9ab4ea1b159f98ddb243b2.webm?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/3294ed33cb9ab4ea1b159f98ddb243b2.mp4?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Picking, Stealing, Fishing, Gathering... etc</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've packed in a lot of interesting RPG elements. You can play the mini-game &quot;Jack Poker&quot; or earn money by working part-time at the tavern...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting and Synthesizing Weapons and Armor</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get equipment by loot or crafting. Please try to aim for the most powerful equipment. There are also unique pieces of equipment that are one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster and Item Encyclopedia</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, ingredients, literature, weapons... tons of things can be collected.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u5ba2\u670dQ\u7fa4\uff1a156688756</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752716648\" /></span>To aid the King, Priestess Konoha plunges into &quot;Grimoire&quot;! The world inside &quot;Grimoire&quot; is formed by another world called Grimoire Land in which Konoha becomes a magical girl, and has come to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752716648\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/e2ab7bc3ad4587fe7b1ffafa3719988b.poster.avif?t=1752716648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/e2ab7bc3ad4587fe7b1ffafa3719988b.webm?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/e2ab7bc3ad4587fe7b1ffafa3719988b.mp4?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with total freedom, unrestricted by scenario progression. Numerous dungeons and towns are scattered across the vast field, appealing to your sense of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party-based RPG</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just the protagonist, but you can also adventure with companions. Along with your companions found around the world, you can strengthen the party, learn unique field skills that bring various benefits wherever you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/3294ed33cb9ab4ea1b159f98ddb243b2.poster.avif?t=1752716648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/3294ed33cb9ab4ea1b159f98ddb243b2.webm?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/extras/3294ed33cb9ab4ea1b159f98ddb243b2.mp4?t=1752716648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Picking, Stealing, Fishing, Gathering... etc</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've packed in a lot of interesting RPG elements. You can play the mini-game &quot;Jack Poker&quot; or earn money by working part-time at the tavern...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting and Synthesizing Weapons and Armor</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get equipment by loot or crafting. Please try to aim for the most powerful equipment. There are also unique pieces of equipment that are one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster and Item Encyclopedia</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, ingredients, literature, weapons... tons of things can be collected.</p>",
